window.products.push({"id":1073041,"name":"Feenixx Earth Science Educational Science Chart Poster Print 24 x 36in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TfvNwVuqL._AC_SL1212_.jpg","description":"Earth Science Space Photo Montage Poster 24x36 by Feenixx Publishing.   This poster shows the many ways that our world has benefited from NASA research. Satellites have given us a whole new perspective on our planet. The topics include mapping terrain, charting global weather systems, analyzing ocean currents, and hurricane tracking. Highly detailed photographs are accompanied by fascinating and informative text.   Customers have been universally impressed with the quality, beauty and detail of these posters. Pictures do not do them justice! This is a new type of poster that we call content intensive posters. Each provides a comprehensive overview of the subject presented through extraordinary images and fact-filled text. They are designed to appeal to people who enjoy reading books, watching informative and/or educational shows on cable television and subscribing to such magazines as \"National Geographic\", \"Smithsonian\" and \"Scientific American\". They have great educational value and are cherished by teachers, students and professionals.   All posters are printed on very heavy, high-quality paper. It is also a very hard paper that preserves tiny details. Posters are then specially coated to provide a satin finish that reduces glare and enhances their presentation. These are the same high standards used to produce expensive art prints. Artists are selected on the basis of their illustration skills and their knowledge of the subect. Many have both art and science degrees. This ensures an accurate presentation of the subject.   All posters measure 24\" x 36\". This standard size fits inexpensive, off the shelf frames if you wish to frame this poster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TfvNwVuqL._AC_SL1212_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feenixx","source_asin":"B076VTRY35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076VTRY35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076VTRY35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
