window.products.push({"id":1073163,"name":"Sobeeting Dining Room Chair Seat Covers Stretch Knitted Jacquard Seat Covers Washable Removable Upholstered Spandex Seat Cushion Protector Covers with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jph5exVJS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【High Stretchy Fabric】The seat cover of the dining chair is made of 92% polyester fiber and 8% spandex. It is soft and stretchable, wrinkle-resistant and durable enough. And the newly added knitted twill makes the kitchen chair cover more durable and non-slip than ordinary chair cover. which can cover your chair perfectly and will not easily reveal the color of the cushion. 【Best Size for Chair】Height is 2.7-3.9 inches (7-10cm); length is 14.1-17.7 inches (36-45cm); width is 14.1-17.7 inches (36-45cm), Please refer to the measurement guide in the displayed picture before purchasing. Due to manual measurement, the size may have an error of 0.5-1 inch. If you are not sure whether your chair is suitable for flexible chair covers, you can email us to ask. 【Jacquard Design】The knitted twill jacquard chair cover is thicker than the ordinary cushion slipcover, which can cover your chair perfectly and will not easily reveal the color of the cushion. Beautiful dining chair slipcovers with multiple colors, suitable for various occasions, such as restaurants, celebrations, living rooms, ceremonies, parties, etc. 【Easy to Installation】The chair seat cover with high elasticity for dining room can be stretched at will, suitable for more chairs, like office chairs, computer chairs, round chairs, etc. In addition, after experimentation and innovation, we chose the buckle to replace the previous tie. It is less likely to fall or slide than the tie, and it can be firmly fixed on the chair. 【Wash Instruction】Machine washable upholstered seat slipcovers are very easy to clean. It supports machine washing in cold water and does not require bleach, because bleach will damage the color and fabric of the seat cover. No ironing is required, only low-temperature drying or sun drying is required. After drying, the chair cover will not be deformed or crease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jph5exVJS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sobeeting","source_asin":"B091TP69SW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091TP69SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091TP69SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1073164,"name":"Mom Wine Glass - Mother's Day - Mom Juice, Because Mommin Ain’t Easy - Unbreakable Plastic Wine Glass - Mother’s Day Gifts - Gift for Mom to be - Cute","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c6qQ1FlhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 2 pack wine glass mom gift includes a special note to mom on the box: To Mom's Everywhere, The nose wiping, the endless laundry, the sleepless nights...it is all a part of the job. It is not easy or glamorous, but the kisses and hugs at the end of the day make it all worth it. Even the best among us can use a glass of wine from time to time. Rest assured that these glasses are made with 100% Tritan, a shatterproof and unbreakable plastic produced in the USA. Perfect for the mom on the go or the mom juggling a newborn while cooking dinner. No more broken glass, even if your toddler takes out your coffee table. Here's to you, Mom. Thank you for all that you do. Need the perfect gift for the mommy in your life? A gift for your mom friends in mom group? Bring a gift for MOM to the baby shower or hospital visit so she can start living her best mom life. She will love this mommy sippy cup! Mom Juice Because Mommin Ain’t Easy wine glasses are the best gift choice for all wine lover moms. With these cute wine glass designs, impress any friend or family member that enjoys a bit of humor. These novelty stemless wine glasses are made with 100% Eastman USA Tritan plastics, making these unbreakable, shatterproof and toddler proof! Purchase these durable stemless wine glasses with ease, knowing they will arrive intact and last for years to come. They are perfect for every occasion and every drink, from wine to mimosas and champagne at brunch picnics and birthday parties. Our premium tritan wine glasses are stemless, making them very easy to hold and grip. They are 100% shatterproof so you can rest assured that they will stay in top condition, even if you drop them. We are so sure you will be satisfied we provide a 100% satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c6qQ1FlhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Offbeat Gifts","source_asin":"B07NSCGLDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NSCGLDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NSCGLDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
