window.products.push({"id":1073204,"name":"Vintage Wood Grain Background with Christmas Quote Let It Snow Decorative Pillow Covers Cotton Linen Merry Christmas Snowman and Snowflake Throw Pillo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7142HiAvtfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Asminifor Aims Luxury and High Quality Home Decor Products to Your Daily Life. Features: Material: The Pillow Covers are made of a coarser fabric, nice and thick. This fabric is also soft and pleasant to the touch.The Fabric made of cotton linen material with a brief design and look,Durable and easy to look after. Size: 18 X 18 Inch per pack, included 1pc Pillow Covers WORKMANSHIP: Exquisite Hidden Zipper Closure was Designed for an Elegant Look, HIdden Zipper Design Can be Opened to Around 34-36 CM for Easy Insertion of Cushion. about 1.45 inch seam are done on the two margins to make sure that the pillow will be naturally full all way round after the insert of the core. Please Kindly Note: 1. We offer PILLOW CASE ONLY, the CORE/INSERT EXCLUDED.2. For Manual Measurement's sake, please accept a 1-2cm more or less allowance.3. Printed on ONE SIDE ONLY, and THE OTHER SIDE IS PLAIN--NO PRINTING.4. The printed pillow case my not be identical with the picture online, due to different exposure rate between monitors and naked eyes. Tips to Stuff your Insert: Step1. Get the core ready, open the pillow case on the zipper side, fold the core and put it inside the pillow case to the bottom. Step2. Let go of your hand, make sure that your core has stuffed the corners of the pillow case, then close the zipper slowly to make sure it doest not split. Step3. Slightly flap on your pillow to make sure the core will sit well. Package Content: 1 x Throw Pillow Covers These throw pillow covers are designed for simple style home decor, Asminifor cushion covers is available for different colors so you can match whichever color tone you like will go best with your decors in Living room, Bedroom, Office and Car. Welcome to our store, If you have any question, pls feel free let is know, Thank u and Wish You Have A Happy Shopping Time !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7142HiAvtfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asminifor","source_asin":"B07ZCTP56T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZCTP56T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZCTP56T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1073205,"name":"CHUN YI Stretch Sofa Slipcovers 2-Piece Couch Cover Furniture Protector Arm Chair Loveseat Coat Soft High Elastic Material, Checks Spandex Rhombus Fab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ltxn2EI3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester,spandex 1. SUPERIOR FABRIC: 85% polyester 15% spandex fabric makes our sofa covers more stretchy and durable, ensuring both good function and comfort. Protect your new sofa from daily wear and tear, spills and stains, and also give your favorite old sofa a new rejuvenated look instead of buying a completely new one. 2. FIT JUST RIGHT: Comes in 4 sizes with LOVESEAT SIZE suitable for sofa between 57\"- 70\". Our sofa covers are stretchy to fit various kinds of sofas like lawson sofa, T-cushion sofa, high arm sofa, leather sofa and so on. You can measure your sofa in advance and compare it to our size chart. If you are not sure about how to choose, contact us and we will help you with all our heart. 3. STAY IN PLACE: Our sofa cover can cover the back of your sofa, providing all-round protection. Tuck the fabric into the grooves to make it more tight and use the cushion to secure the slipcover stay in place firmly. 1 Package contains 1 sofa cover and 1 cushion cover. For detailed installation steps, please find our install instruction in the package or feel free to contact us. 4. EFFORTLESS CARE: Not only will our sofa cover protect your sofa from accidental dirt like biscuit crumbs and daily wear and tear, but also it is very easy to clean, saving you much effort. Machine washable with similar colors. Do Not Bleach. For drying, tumble dry low and remove them promptly from dryer. 5. TIPS: This light color slipcover is more suitable for light color sofa. With a brief style and appealing colors, our slipcovers match well for your most different styles of furniture and decoration. Due to the diverse light and monitor display, colors may slightly differ from picture and product, but please be assured that we never stop trying our best to reduce the color difference to the minimum as far as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ltxn2EI3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUN YI","source_asin":"B07CWR4VGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CWR4VGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CWR4VGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
