window.products.push({"id":1073246,"name":"Custom-Made, Faux Wood Horizontal Window Blinds, 2 Inch Slats, Inside Mount, Espresso (Dark Brown,) Inside Window Size: 70\" W x 64\" L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R4PrhPVTL._AC_SL1084_.jpg","description":"These window blinds are custom made to order and are not pre-made, stocked blinds. Our inside mount 2\" Faux Wood Golden Oak window blinds have the rich, natural look of real wood, but offer advantages that wood cannot. Our Faux wood slats are made of a polyvinyl blend that is warp resistant and are best suited for humid conditions, making these blinds ideal for kitchens and bathrooms. Our Faux Wood material is also Greengaurd Certified for both Air Control Quality and Children and Schools. MEASURING INTRUCTIONS: Please do not use the measurements of a blind that needs replacing. Instead, please read our measuring instructions located in our photos. Our blinds are recommended for window casings that are at least 3\" deep because if less than that, the blinds will protrude and you will be able to see the metal installation brackets from a side angle (VALANCES DO NOT COME WITH CORNER PIECES.)DISCLAIMER ONLY FOR FAUX WOOD ESPRESSO: Should not be installed in an area where this material is exposed to degrees hotter than 120 F in temperature because warping may occur.All computer monitors are different from one another, therefore, the colors that you see online may not be 100% accurate to what you see in person. We STRONGLY RECOMMEND requesting FREE COLOR SAMPLES from us so that you are completely satisfied, please call (678)745-4113 to request free samples or Contact Us on Amazon. DELTA BLINDS SUPPLY'S RETURN POLICY: Buyers pay for return shipping, a 30% restocking fee on all blind returns as they are all custom cut to size to order. Before placing your order, please verify and confirm the sizes and colors you are ordering are accurate so that you are completely satisfied. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R4PrhPVTL._AC_SL1084_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Blinds Supply","source_asin":"B017DJLZMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017DJLZMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017DJLZMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1073247,"name":"Dexter-Russell (S8699) -8\"\" x 4\"\" Steak Turner-Traditional(TM) Series, 8&quot, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DF13a2CSL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"For your biggest burgers and steaks, try the 8\" x 4\" Dexter-Russell Steak Turner. This kitchen utensil is one of the best all-round tools for restaurants that serve a lot of burgers and steaks. The eight inch length and four inch width gives this turner a large surface area, perfect for sliding under and holding large cuts of meat. The offset blade is made from stainless steel and the handle is a nice rosewood secured to the steel with strong brass rivets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DF13a2CSL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dexter-Russell","source_asin":"B001505ONW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001505ONW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001505ONW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
