window.products.push({"id":1073256,"name":"Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, Cordless Vacuum with 20Kpa Super Suction, 80000 RPM High-Speed Brushless Motor, 5 Stages High Efficiency Filtration, Up to 30","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vV4nzOugL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's your dog, but you are its all. According to relevant studies, the average life span of dogs is only about 12 to 15 years. So, please clean up the garbage in time to give them a clean and healthy living environment. [ 2022 NEWLY-UPGRADED BRUSHLESS MOTOR ] Our vacuum cleaner is equipped with a 80,000 rpm high-speed brushless motor and its speed is more than twice that of an ordinary 30,000 rpm brush motor. The cordless vacuum cleaner can stably output 250W high power and 20Kpa super suction, which can effectively remove all kinds of ground dust. [ REMOVABLE HIGH-EFFICIENCY LARGE BATTERY ] Our small vacuum cleaner is equipped with 6*2200 mAh lithium batteries and it can run for up to 30 minutes. Even if you have a 135 square meter room, it's just a piece of cake for our vacuum cleaner cordless. And detachable battery is convenient for charging and repair. [ 5 STAGES HIGH EFFICIENCY FILTRATION ] In addition to the traditional 4 stages filtration system, Our cordless stick vacuum is also designed with high efficiency filter at the air outlet to make the exhaust air cleaner, effectively avoiding secondary pollution and bringing cleaner air to the family. [ NEWLY-UPGRADED ROLLER BRUSH and LED HEADLIGHTS ] Our stick vacuum cleaner is equipped with a brand new 2-in-1 roller brush, eliminating the hassle of replacing the roller brush. In this way, it can be easily used on the floor and carpet. The LED headlight design makes dust hidden in dark corners nowhere to escape. [ Extension Rod and Multifunction ] The mini vacuum cleaner weighs 2.6 kg and can be easily switched from a hardwood floor vacuum to a portable hand vacuum cordless. The height-adjustable extension bar can meet your different requirements and improve the comfort of cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vV4nzOugL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZokerVacuum","source_asin":"B09YQ34SGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YQ34SGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YQ34SGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
