window.products.push({"id":1073361,"name":"BINGONE Upgraded 5 Blades Heat Powered Stove Fan with Magnetic Thermometer Silent Operation Eco Fireplace Fan for Wood/Log Burning Stoves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GPcnEILvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Heat powered: Made with high-temperature resistant anodized aluminum,which is rust-proof, wear-resisting, with good thermal conductivity. The stove fan surface temperature is between 122°F - 662°F (50°C - 350°C).The fan spins when the temperature is reached 122 ºF. Efficiently circulates warm air throughout the room. Eco-friendly: No batteries or electricity required. The thermodynamic stove fan uses the low to absorb heat energy to convert the temperature difference into electrical energy. The moelectric module acts as a small generator to power the fan's motor. More efficiently distribute heat and save fuel, eco-friendly. Upgraded Silent operation: 5 blades circulates more warm air into your whole home, faster Speed, larger air volume, lower noise. You don't even know the stove fan is there,but you feel the warmth. Overheating Protection: The metal sheet at the bottom of fan will protect the stove fan when the temperature is higher than 662°F. It will raise the edge of the fan slightly to protect the motor and the moelectric module. Easy to install: Just place on a flat surface on the top of stove away from flue pipe. It will working when the stove surface hot. The stove fan includes the stove thermometer,which can monitor the temperature of your fireplace.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GPcnEILvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINGONE","source_asin":"B08MX8J3DV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MX8J3DV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MX8J3DV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
