window.products.push({"id":1073387,"name":"PJ Wood 5 Tier A-Frame Ladder Shelf - Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hg5d62n6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There's nothing like having that one standout piece in your home, and that is this nifty ladder shelf by PJ Wood. It's not only a snazzy bookcase to store your favorite items, the design itself is definitely unique. It's well made, so you don't have to worry about anything falling apart and collapsing. Another important factor is that it exudes nothing but great style and superb taste. Assembly is definitely required. Decorating Dreams This A-frame ladder bookcase looks like you just want to climb up on it, but unfortunately, that's not allowed. You do get to admire the shelf itself, and all of the interesting doodads you want on display. With an array of shelves, you get to go wild and decorate till your heart's content. Includes ShelvesToolsHardware Unique Design You definitely stop and stare at this 5 tier ladder shelf. It is quite the showpiece. By mixing a ladder and a shelf, you get people to appreciate your decor style. Not only the height it brings to a room, but the slant, and the many shelves you have available to show off your prized possessions. Sturdy Construction Bookshelves can sometimes be flimsy, so you want to make sure that when you're in the market for one, be sure to choose one that is sturdy. With this ladder bookshelf, you don't have to worry about a rickety and wobbly bookcase because it's made from long-lasting, well-constructed, solid wood. Maintenance When it comes to this leaning bookshelf, you don't have to do much to keep it clean. Of course, if you add a lot of accessories to it, you'll have to make sure you dust at least every few days or once a week, but with the shelf itself, a little mild soap and water and either a paper towel, rag, or cloth will be sufficient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hg5d62n6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PJ Wood","source_asin":"B07T1HXT2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T1HXT2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T1HXT2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
