window.products.push({"id":1073393,"name":"GESPERT Bento Box for Adult, Large Capacity 316 Stainless Steel Lunch Box Container with Insulated Bag and Durable Spork, Microwave/Freezer/Dishwasher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dhh9r3H2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Bento Box: Made of food-grade PP plastic and 316 stainless steel which is higher level material than 304 stainless steel, we guarantee a safe food container for you. With large capacity of 1500ml/52.9oz and weight 650g, this bento box is good for adults, to-go food container. Microwave Dishwasher and Freezer Safe: Open the container lid and soup bowl lid before put into microwave, pull up the silicone flower in soup bowl lid to release the air pressure and it will be easy to open. Suggest to wash the plastic part with hand to avoid deformation, removable stainless steel container and bowl are free to washed by dishwasher. Leak Proof Design: The sealing ring and locks work together to avoid liquid leak out, place the food in compartments and hold box in horizontal or food will leak between trays. Pour boiled water under the stainless steel container to get warm food when microwave is unavailable.(the water under the bottom of the tray is not leak proof, so pour the boiled water when it’s dining time). When you are doing leak proof test, please take out the bowl first because the buoyancy will influence the result. Lunch Box for Office&Trip: Reasonable divide your pasta, sushi, bread, sandwich, salad, fruit, soup in the 4 compartments and enjoy the fresh food in office and picnic place. Fashion outlook and large capacity are good idea for office people. What You Will Receive: Best quality lunch box, a durable spork and insulated bag, plus our warm customer service and return policy. If you have any problems or questions about your order, welcome to reach us and we will try our best to offer you a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dhh9r3H2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GESPERT","source_asin":"B09Y8Z7QWN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y8Z7QWN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y8Z7QWN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1073394,"name":"R and D Handicrafts 5-String Handcrafted Boho Pom Pom Garland with Gold Bell. The Colorful Bohemian Accent You Have Been Looking for 4 FT Per String (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SojzOH8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ The R and D Handicrafts 5-String Multi Color Rainbow Pom Pom Garlands - Living Room Decorations, Party Decor, Rustic Curtain Fringe - Indian Wedding, Diwali Festivities, Marigold, Bohemian Hanging Interiors - 4 FT Per String. 20FT OF GARLANDS TOTAL. Each packet contains 5 strings of the garland just like the pictures on Amazon with Hot Pink, Hot Orange, Yellow and Red Pom Poms and Bells. ✔ LUSH DECORATIVE POM POMS - Our beaded pom pom garland comes in a rich shade of hot pink and has an ornamental bell at the end. This is a shabby chic macrame alternative. Its gold beads and accents lend it a lavish look. Hang next to a photo display as wall hanging decor or with your white fairy lights. ✔ PERFECT FOR YOUR INDOOR TEEPEE - These hanging pom pom decorations are perfect for your children's tee pee. They're large enough to enhance any bedroom and colorful enough to be the perfect piece for any nursery. Whether you are into the macreme or macrome theme these garlands will be great for any Bohemian theme. ✔ EXCELLENT CRAFTSMANSHIP - Nothing compares to a decorative garland that is handmade. Heart and skills are poured into every item. You can count on it to have superior quality and durability. ✔ TRADITIONAL INDIAN DECOR - Want to stay true to your roots? Choose a wall decoration that gives your space the Indian backdrop you crave. It’s great for both your place of work and your home. ✔ DREAMY BOHEMIAN DECORS - Match these handmade Boho Felt Ball Pom Pom Garlands with your Boho tapestry for the perfect Accent. Everyone will love your pom pom string. These garlands are a great addition to your Bohemian interiors and will complement your Boho decorations beautifully.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SojzOH8rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R and D Handicrafts","source_asin":"B08BZW78PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BZW78PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BZW78PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
