window.products.push({"id":1073515,"name":"CUNSENR Premium Meat Chopper for Ground Beef - Heat Resistant Meat Masher - Easy to Chop & Clean - Durable Nylon Ground Beef Smasher - Non Stick Hambu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-PiABiOPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【AMAZING MEAT CHOPPER】- Still struggling to chop and crumble meats when cooking? CUNSENR meat chopper features 5 beveled pinwheel blades helping you chop and crumble food easier and faster, saving you time and effort! Its sturdy structure enables it to achieve more than 1000 TIMES quick chops, mixes and mashes. Durable for long-lasting use. ✅【EASY TO USE】- Grab the Meat Masher. Press 5 blades into the meat, stir slightly and mash to the consistency you want. Use the angled blade to scrape any remaining meat from the sides of cookware. Then, you quickly get one dish of perfect ground meat! Much easier than using spatula or spoon. The ergonomic, non-slip grip makes chopping and mixing a breeze! ✅【EASY TO CLEAN】- Our ground beef smasher is made of food-grade nylon that is non-stick, odorless, and BPA-free. It ensures that food particles don't get stuck, making cleaning up quick and easy. Simply put it in the dishwasher or wash it by hand with a little soap and water. Easy to clean and dishwasher safe! ✅【IDEAL KITCHEN TOOL】- Better and more efficient than spatula or spoon, our meat chopper is not just for meat, but also suitable for eggs, gelatin, fruits, vegetables, and more! Its heat resistance is up to 220℃/428℉, ensuring safe and convenient use in all types of cookware such as pots, pans, etc. An amazing professional kitchen tool for you! ✅【CUNSENR GUARANTEE 100%】- Our meat chopper is supported with guarantee for lifetime. If there is any issue with the meat chopper, just contact us and we will make it right. Shop it now and your meat chopper is insured!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-PiABiOPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUNSENR","source_asin":"B0BYRCPHMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYRCPHMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYRCPHMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
