window.products.push({"id":1073585,"name":"Gallery Prints Set of Four (4) Fishing Lure Pinup Girl Mini Poster Tool Box Magnets - Each Measure 3\" Wide by 4\" high (77mm Wide x 102mm high)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sO7koA0BL._AC_SL1059_.jpg","description":"At Carlson Brands , our goal is to produce a selection of the highest quality reproductive art prints, maps & posters. By combining a professional satin PolyPro production material with our state of the art Giclée printing process, we are able to offer the best quality & the most desirable characteristics – accurate colors, archival properties as well as both tear & water resistance. Additionally, for select products, we offer the same quality production on a heavy-gauge artists canvas production material.Our large catalog of first generation images have been digitally captured directly from original documents and therefore display both the original look & tone; sometimes, this may include small tears, flaws and aging, which adds to the authenticity, presentation and beauty of the piece. Ultimately, our process allows us to offer you the opportunity to secure a high quality, low cost image for your home, office or living space...and many are sized to fit into the more economical standard frame formats (frames sold separately). Shipping & Handling We ship art prints, posters & maps in heavy-gauge mailing tubes to ensure that each and every item gets delivered to your door in perfect \"ready to frame\" condition. Guarantee Our customers matter and the quality of your experience is our top priority. In the event that you are not satisfied with any item, you many return it within 30 days of receipt for a replacement or a refund. Shop with Confidence 100% Satisfaction Guarantee No Hassle Returns Secure, Fast Shipping","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sO7koA0BL._AC_SL1059_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gallery Prints","source_asin":"B00SH503C0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SH503C0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SH503C0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1073586,"name":"MINI TIM3 MACHIN3 8-Cup Rice Cooker, Slow Cooker, Yogurt Maker & Food Steamer with Fuzzy Logic 2.0","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819E6xUvB0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Faster, better rice: cooks rice up to 27% faster than competing similarly sized digital rice cookers. Cooks between 1/2 cup to 4 cups dry rice (yields 1 to 8 cups cooked rice). Smarter: Fuzzy Logic 2.0 monitors temperature above and below the cooking pot for outstanding results– and NO boiling over A slow cooker sized for two: 1.75 quart capacity slow cooks all your favorites in small batches The easiest way to make homemade yogurt: heats milk for you, allows it to cool, tells you when to add culture, incubates it up to 12 hours And much more: programmable steamer, toast-then-cook quinoa, perfectly cooks oatmeal, programmable delay timer and automatic keep warm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819E6xUvB0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3 Squares","source_asin":"B01H0G3N1E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H0G3N1E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H0G3N1E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
