window.products.push({"id":1073630,"name":"American Thread Collection 6-Piece Microfiber Bed Sheet Set - Deep Pocket - Cool and Wrinkle Free (Queen, Seamless Pattern Teal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1vygkfkwCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There’s nothing better than climbing into bed after a long day. Your body is tired and you just need to catch some Zzzzs before you need to get up and do it all over again. Making up your bed with this American Thread Collection 6-Piece Microfiber Bed Sheet Set will provide you with the sleep haven you’re looking for . Inviting and extremely comfortable , this sheet set is expertly crafted with double brushed microfiber for softness and durability . The fabric is lightweight and breathable to keep you comfortable in any season, soft to the touch and pleasing against your skin . As such, it will provide you with long-lasting strength and comfort for years to come. The American Thread Collection is offered in a variety of print and floral patterns with bold color choices to choose from. There’s certain to be a design to catch everyone’s eye, allowing you to furnish your bedroom with a fresh, new look . For added convenience, the sheets are also offered in all four sizes to accommodate all mattresses. Caring for the sheets couldn’t be easier . They’re machine washable and wrinkle-free , allowing you to take them from the dryer to the mattress without the hassle of ironing. Plus, they’ll look as crisp and clean as they did when they were brand new! In addition to the soft comfort, stylish design and easy care, the fitted sheets also boast deep pockets to accommodate thick mattresses . Deeper in the corners than standard sheets, these fitted sheets will easily stretch over the mattress to provide a perfect fit without popping off . Say good-bye to discomfort caused by a bunched up sheet at the foot or head of the bed, and hello to a luxurious sleep experience every single night!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1vygkfkwCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Thread Collection","source_asin":"B07F9D4M2V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F9D4M2V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F9D4M2V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1073631,"name":"Cybrtrayd Large Chick Lolly Easter Chocolate Candy Mold with 50 4.5-Inch Lollipop Sticks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717hhVYZQ4L._AC_SL1152_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques. To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision. Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717hhVYZQ4L._AC_SL1152_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B00HJM4BES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HJM4BES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HJM4BES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
