window.products.push({"id":1073633,"name":"Personal Comfort 13\" A8 Bed vs Sleep Number i8 Bed - King Mattress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AS8PFUrvL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Exceptional in quality and luxurious in design, the Elegance Series includes nearly every feature imaginable, complete with our exclusive, patented, reversible top cover allowing you to flip over and zip to your center panel giving your mattress a longer life, allowing you to spread the wear and tear across two sides of the top panel. We recommend flipping the cover every 6 months to take full advantage of this feature. Our patented, zipped center panel design also gives you access to the center comfort layers. This panel contains an evolution foam comfort layer and a ventilated gel-infused Visco memory foam layer which makes rotating the foam layers for longer life much easier. You can even upgrade your mattress. Comes standard with our digital state-of-the-art pump system that utilizes a medically recognized pressure scale with 45 number settings, from 5 to 50. Our 2-Zone technology allows adjustment for each sleeper and our touch screen digital hand controls offer individualized personalization. Remote app now available for Android on Google Play and will be available for iOS in July 2016, just search for Personal Comfort Bed in the app store and download today. Connect directly to your mattress and control wirelessly using our free downloadable app. Build and materials: “Duvet Style\" Cotton Pillow Top Zipped Panel, Woven Cotton Zipper Cover, Polyurethane Foam (1.8/28), Fire Barrier, Microbial, Vulcanized Rubber, Electric Pump System, Wired Remotes, Reinforced Air Hoses. All Personal Comfort products contain certified flexible polyurethane foams certified by CertiPUR-US, a not-for-profit certification program for foam used in bedding products. When you see the CertiPUR-US seal, you can be confident that the flexible polyurethane foam inside meets CertiPUR-US standards for content, emissions, and durability, and has been analyzed by independent, accredited testing laboratories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AS8PFUrvL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personal Comfort","source_asin":"B00CHSOZZO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1073633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CHSOZZO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CHSOZZO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
